					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I seriously enjoy the way skips have the ability to so cleanly blend the absurd and the serious, and when authors really lean into that, it produces some magic. Should I be laughing at the absurd imagery or gasping at the horror wrought upon this suburban family? The answer is yes, and the vote is +1.</p> 
